  m_text: "Welcome to Vapor Waves.\n\nFeel free to roam around this aesthetic abyss,
    heal your weary soul, click some pineapples, and mingle with some questionable
    strangers. Enjoy your stay.\n\nJust a heads-up: there\u2019s no volume control.
    You\u2019ll have to physically abuse your computer\u2019s volume buttons yourself.
    For the ultimate experience, we strongly recommend not wearing headphones. \n(It
    gets pretty loud, honestly.)"
